title: 'C-c v R : skg-readable-ids-refresh'
pid: 28f67f51-60ad-41a8-bc7c-bb91f9afb83b
body: |2-
  Empties the session's ID-to-title cache (see =C-c v r=) and
  re-annotates the current buffer. Use it after anything that changes
  what titles the server would answer with: a node retitled, or a
  skgrepo widening (IDs restricted under the old skgrepo restriction
  were cached as unresolvable). Both keys are bound in content views only;
  in a magit or raw .skg buffer, use M-x.
